      {
       "t": "Alvarion Windfield: turn in Deliver the News. The Planting Shovel, Roofing Hammer and Trusty Wrench are one-handed weapons; take the one for your class."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Valennia Stormfist: turn in Bugged."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Train your level 10 spells at your class trainer."
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
