      {
       "t": "Ruins of Ban'aethal, north-west (56.7-59, 27-34): loot 8 Abandoned Belongings from the ground and find Resaan's Heirloom (57.0, 29.4). Kill Wind Hollows for 10 Wind Hollow Essence."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Low drop rate: 10 Essences took 28 Wind Hollows (36%), about 16 minutes. The Belongings and the Heirloom were done after 5 minutes, so the last 11 minutes were Wind Hollows only. They're level 10-11 and give about 92 XP each, so it's still close to grinding speed. Most Wind Hollows are at 57-58, 29-31."
      }
     ]
    }
